ason\": \"Specs-root flip made dates uniform\", \"evidence\": \"git log\" },\n31:     { \"approach\": \"Mutable timeline.md\", \"reason\": \"Would destroy chronology guarantee\", \"evidence\": \"iter 5 design\" }\n32:   ]\n33: }\n\n(End of file - total 33 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"{\n  \"openQuestions\": [\n    \"Whether to adopt the optional z_archive/ sub-split for genuinely-complete leaf phases in addition to the 9-grandparent grouping\",\n    \"Whether 057-phase-consolidation-research should be renamed/absorbed into the implementation packet once the proposal is approved\",\n    \"Whether the migration should be one commit or one commit per grandparent group (M7 options)\"\n  ],\n  \"resolvedQuestions\": [\n    \"Q1: Merging/grouping the 036 children into fewer multi-phase parents is feasible and beneficial — spec-kit health check classifies 45 children as error and recommends splitting into nested phase parents (iter 1)\",\n    \"Q2: 9 grandparents cover all 45 children, program-ordered and dependency-safe (iter 2-3)\",\n    \"Q3: M0-M7 migration plan with lockstep surface updates, hash recompute, regeneration of specs/descriptions.json, gates, and lossless rollback (iter 4)\",\n    \"Q4: timeline.md schema — seq=created_at, stable_id=slug, moved_to, append-only renumber ledger (iter 5)\",\n    \"Q5: Risks = validate.sh hash-lock, pre-existing 053-056/057 drift, symlink, regenerated index; gates = M6 + timeline verification (iter 4-5)\"\n  ],\n  \"keyFindings\": [\n    \"45 on-disk children (001-033, 035, 047-057); 13 already phase-parents holding 61 grandchildren; 32 leaves\",\n    \"is-phase-parent.js health returns error (45 > 40 threshold): 'Split into nested phase parents'\",\n    \"validate.sh hardcodes a 40-entry sha256-locked 036 manifest (001-033, 035, 047-052); 053-056 are on disk but absent (pre-existing drift)\",\n    \"specs/descriptions.json is a regenerated MCP folder-discovery cache (3207 entries, 133 036-related) — never hand-edit\",\n    \"050-trustworthy-state-records.created_at = 2026-07-27 (before 019-032) but numbered 050 — numeric prefix is not chronological\",\n    \"034<->036 renumber precedent (commit 8d3b5b21d57) + specs-root flip (606e55cb8a9) make raw git first-commit dates unusable per-child\",","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0144-system-deep-loop-036-p0-remediation/specs/system-deep-loop/036-deep-loop-innovation/057-phase-consolidation-research/research/lineages/ds-b/findings-registry.json","text":"{\n  \"openQuestions\": [\n    \"Whether to adopt the optional z_archive/ sub-split for genuinely-complete leaf phases in addition to the 9-grandparent grouping\",\n    \"Whether 057-phase-consolidation-research should be renamed/absorbed into the implementation packet once the proposal is approved\",\n    \"Whether the migration should be one commit or one commit per grandparent group (M7 options)\"\n  ],\n  \"resolvedQuestions\": [\n    \"Q1: Merging/grouping the 036 children into fewer multi-phase parents is feasible and beneficial — spec-kit health check classifies 45 children as error and recommends splitting into nested phase parents (iter 1)\",\n    \"Q2: 9 grandparents cover all 45 children, program-ordered and dependency-safe (iter 2-3)\",\n    \"Q3: M0-M7 migration plan with lockstep surface updates, hash recompute, regeneration of specs/descriptions.json, gates, and lossless rollback (iter 4)\",\n    \"Q4: timeline.md schema — seq=created_at, stable_id=slug, moved_to, append-only renumber ledger (iter 5)\",\n    \"Q5: Risks = validate.sh hash-lock, pre-existing 053-056/057 drift, symlink, regenerated index; gates = M6 + timeline verification (iter 4-5)\"\n  ],\n  \"keyFindings\": [\n    \"45 on-disk children (001-033, 035, 047-057); 13 already phase-parents holding 61 grandchildren; 32 leaves\",\n    \"is-phase-parent.js health returns error (45 > 40 threshold): 